index 0f89ce4..2e6ab9b 100644
--- a/load_tools/README.md
+++ b/load_tools/README.md
@@ -3,6 +3,8 @@
 Everything here uses made-up data and loopback addresses only. No real model, mail or CRM service is ever called.
 Run every tool from the repository root with `PYTHONPATH=src:.` (on Windows use `;` between the entries: `src;.`), as in the other run commands in contract.md.
 
+Every file path you give a tool (`--log`, `--facts`, `--requests`, `--book`, `--json`, ...) must lie inside the folder you started it in, the repository folder, or the system temporary folder; a path that leaves them (`..`, an absolute path elsewhere, a link that points out) is refused with a message. To use another folder, name it in the environment variable `LEAD_DESK_PATH_ROOTS` (several folders separated by `:`, or `;` on Windows). The same rule applies to `scripts/n8n_api.py import FILE`, `scripts/run_real_check.py --config` and `tools/scrub_n8n_export.py`.
+
 | File | What it does |
 |---|---|
 | `load_driver.py` | Sends requests to the desk's `POST /leads` on a fixed schedule and writes the **request log**. |
